ense PK battles up close on the big virtual screen for a comprehensively upgraded interactive experience.", "short_description": "Douyin VR Live is a next-generation VR user-facing streaming platform that is committed to bringing you an exhilarating and immersive interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logozh.png", "id": "1439261319980082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441583_1439261323313415_6105103478412624436_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yZzSr65t7T8Q7kNvwEtoZod&_nc_oc=AdraIxUk4ftvI3WZfl5I6nGo2L5jxbhZJBqxTbEZSlUg7HAIkuUIEJ4F9C6_kiE573M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2W4TlemLX6GcRJ4kx_TnVYUZRAkCA1zVKbcuIx_47EBQ&oe=69F0C71C"}, {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1222877525073722", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982446_1222877528407055_8056433039736167714_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yw4AL-1vr5kQ7kNvwFyaa2N&_nc_oc=AdpAeizWICGK-BFztSiibnfsbQXxOGhACmPqe7RV3pwDcwFMcVmKn2aP1FfCAzaxl2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0RIlTZiGiNLG8WWHkd2MQkl61buKdhrlu1ngD2bCifVw&oe=69F0C21C"}, {"file_name": "1440 x 1440.png", "id": "961925418233844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036617_961925421567177_3841510894552774559_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HGuxH1dqwV4Q7kNvwGAUh3C&_nc_oc=AdqWsWVlMEZEbMsYjwPByLsOL3CsOXeegatzydQgr6-SzaF-cZNoVUVk9nDPoCCJDfQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af17qg8oN-yp7FKl_A2yxydGK9L8uoMa3ylXlDJICblTNw&oe=69F0D205"}, {"file_name": "1080X360.png", "id": "715848710371996", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974523_715848713705329_284747130245148719_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=889FeeXnIDMQ7kNvwHTabhI&_nc_oc=AdprCVKjCdpp